Connector micro-bend ≤ 0.3 Flexure-induced loss variation
Modal noise ≤ 0.2 Multimode interference statistics
Thermal drift of filters ≤ 0.2 Wavelength misalignment
Total SCL ≤ 1.0 FIT 10^{-9}/h

